like.

Also note that taming/charm monster does not increase the tameness of an
existing pet. If you want to increase tameness with those, make the pet
untame first, then re-tame it (often easier said than done, such as in
this case); this will reset the tameness. Other ways to increase tameness
are food (for eating pets) and the blessed Book of the Dead (only some
kinds of pets).

